		measure 'Bar Color Order Count' = ```
				
				VAR ThisLocation = SELECTEDVALUE(Dim_Branch[LocationID])
				VAR ThisOrderCount = [Order Count]
				
				VAR MaxOrderCount = 
				CALCULATE(
				    MAXX(
				        VALUES(Dim_Branch[LocationID]),
				        [Order Count]
				    ),
				    REMOVEFILTERS(Dim_Branch)
				)
				
				VAR MinOrderCount = 
				CALCULATE(
				    MINX(
				        VALUES(Dim_Branch[LocationID]),
				        [Order Count]
				    ),
				    REMOVEFILTERS(Dim_Branch)
				)
				
				RETURN
				    IF(
				        ThisOrderCount = MaxOrderCount || ThisOrderCount = MinOrderCount,
				        1, // Highlight
				        0  // Grey
				    )
				
				```
			formatString: 0
			lineageTag: 15814614-711b-4b0e-8140-e3ef10119673

